		adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Sex</i> (called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σέξ</span> by Ptolem.; Saxetanum in the
			Itiner.), <i>a town of</i> Hispania Baetica, <i>Sexitan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colias,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
